description:
Qualifications Bachelor's Degree in Mass Communication, Journalism, Multimedia, Visual Communication, Film Production, or related field.; Certification in Video Editing, Graphic Design, or Digital Media is an added advantage.; 
 Experience 25 years of experience in content creation, videography, and video editing.; Experience in healthcare, hospital, or healthcare marketing is preferred.; 
 Content Production Plan, create, and produce engaging healthcare-related content for digital and social media platforms.; Coordinate with doctors, department heads, and marketing teams to develop educational and promotional content.; Create scripts, storyboards, captions, and content calendars.; Cover hospital events, awareness programs, conferences, camps, and celebrations.; 
 Video Editing Edit videos for social media, website, YouTube, digital displays, and internal communications.; Add graphics, animations, transitions, subtitles, voiceovers, and special effects.; Optimize videos for different platforms and formats.; Maintain consistency with hospital branding guidelines.; 
 Photography Videography Capture professional photographs and videos of hospital facilities, medical procedures (with necessary approvals), doctors, staff, and events.; Manage lighting, audio, camera settings, and shooting equipment.; Organize and maintain digital media assets.; 
 Social Media Digital Content Create reels, short videos, patient testimonials, health tips, doctor interviews, and awareness campaigns.; Support social media marketing initiatives through creative visual content.; Monitor content performance and suggest improvements based on engagement metrics.; 
 Brand Management Ensure all content aligns with the hospital's brand identity and ethical standards.; Maintain patient confidentiality and obtain necessary consent before publishing content.; Ensure compliance with healthcare advertising and communication guidelines.; 
 Coordination Communication Work closely with doctors, clinical departments, HR, and marketing teams.; Coordinate with external agencies, designers, and vendors when required.; Meet project timelines and campaign deadlines.; 
 Technical Skills Proficiency in Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, Photoshop, Illustrator, and Canva.; Knowledge of video production, camera handling, lighting, and audio recording.; Understanding of social media platforms and digital marketing trends.; Basic motion graphics and animation skills. 


