 Malayalam Content Writer /PR 

 Description 
 --> Qualification:; Journalism/ Mass communication in Malayalam/ BA Malayalam 

 Content Writing Communication Create engaging Malayalam content for social media, website, blogs, patient education materials, brochures, newsletters, and advertisements.; Draft press releases, success stories, doctor profiles, event reports, and health awareness articles.; Translate content between Malayalam and English while maintaining accuracy and consistency.; Ensure all content aligns with the hospital's brand guidelines and communication standards.; Coordinate with doctors and clinical departments to develop healthcare-related content.; 
 Public Relations Build and maintain positive relationships with media representatives, journalists, and local community stakeholders.; Coordinate press conferences, media interviews, and hospital events.; Prepare media kits, press notes, and public announcements.; Monitor media coverage and prepare PR performance reports.; Handle communication during special campaigns, awareness programs, and crisis situations.; 
 Branding Marketing Support Support branding campaigns to enhance hospital visibility and reputation.; Develop promotional content for healthcare services, specialty departments, and medical camps.; Assist in organizing health talks, awareness programs, exhibitions, and community outreach activities.; Coordinate with digital marketing teams for campaign execution and content promotion.; 
 Business Development Support Promote hospital services through effective communication and public engagement.; Build relationships with corporates, institutions, associations, and referral partners.; Assist in planning and executing patient acquisition and retention initiatives.; Support marketing and business development activities to increase service utilization. 


